<title>JAPAN: Alps Electric, Ichikoh develop new LCD technology.</title>
<headline>Alps Electric, Ichikoh develop new LCD technology.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alps Electric Co Ltd said on Thursday that it, Ichikoh Industries Ltd, Tohoku University and an unlisted company had jointly developed a new technology that cuts production costs for liquid crystal displays (LCDs).</p>
<p>&quot;We have developed the technology but we don't know yet whether we can put it into commercial use,&quot; an Alps spokesman said.</p>
</text>
